OL,3,GNEWSAThe hidden health toll of being a
OL,4,Alorry driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong hours behind the wheel, limited
OL,7,Fopportunities to exercise and the
OL,8,Floneliness of life on the road can all
OL,9,Ftake their toll on lorry drivers, those
OL,10,Fin the industry say.
OL,12,FA free health-check initiative is
OL,13,Fencouraging drivers to pay closer
OL,14,Fattention to their wellbeing, offering
OL,15,Fchecks ranging from blood pressure and
OL,16,Fcholesterol to mental health support.
OL,18,FThe Great Driver MOT visited The Stop
OL,19,Fat The Hollies truck stop in Cannock,
OL,20,FStaffordshire, with drivers invited to
OL,21,Ftake part in a range of health tests
OL,22,Fand receive personalised advice.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
