OL,3,GNEWSAThe hidden health toll of being a
OL,4,Alorry driver
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People don't realise when they're
OL,7,Fcoming into this industry the
OL,8,Floneliness you can feel being a
OL,9,Fdriver," said Darren Noon, from
OL,10,FCannock.
